{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:40:626","content":{"id":626,"title":"Dijkstra 算法","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"663a8123-1341-4b5e-8e87-99365e354f58","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Dijkstra 算法它能够求解单源最短路径问题，并且使用该算法有一个前提，图中不能存在负权边，即图中的每条边的权值都必须是大于等于 0 的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f2108f9e-2c74-4912-83d7-d83adf0138e9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Dijkstra 算法使用一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组来表示从源 s 到其他节点的最短距离，例如 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[v]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示的就是源 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"s"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 到达节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"v"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的最短距离，在初始时，除了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[s]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 0，其余的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[v]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 均为无穷大。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"818fec2d-9a19-4624-8e0c-4ef637308ce0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Dijkstra 算法的思想是，每次从未遍历的节点，寻找在 dis 数组中值最小的节点，然后根据这个节点更新其未被遍历过的相邻节点在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组中的值。例如遍历到节点 v，其相邻节点为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"w"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，并且节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"w"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 未被遍历过，如果 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[v] + weight(v,w) < dis[w]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"​，那么就更新 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[w]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，其中 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"weight(v, w)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是边 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"v-w"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的权值。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"255e567c-2153-4ea7-9d31-f59a60561f1b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"举个例子，假设源为节点 0，我们求解节点 0 到各个节点的最短路径"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29890094/105992542-3ac71b00-60e0-11eb-9d10-6e81f55fb87f.png","previewUrl":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29890094/105992542-3ac71b00-60e0-11eb-9d10-6e81f55fb87f.png","width":645.8333076702235,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"7e2daa7e-9e10-402e-94e0-5a4de6fd950f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4d3ad69c-5cb0-4531-8125-cb5c5d0db437","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"初始节点 0 到节点 0 的距离为 0，其余节点距离节点 0 的距离为 。根据 Dijkstra 算法，每次从未遍历的节点，寻找在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组中值最小的节点，所以此时我们找到了节点 0，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[0]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 0，比其他元素小。我们来到节点 0，根据公式 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[0] + weight(0, w) < dis[w]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"更新与 0 相邻的节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"w"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29890094/105998635-d60fbe80-60e7-11eb-833d-96b338557e09.png","previewUrl":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29890094/105998635-d60fbe80-60e7-11eb-833d-96b338557e09.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"82bc76c5-6ae4-4971-b0da-8f4f8f5a2eaf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c6b23cc9-47ba-4432-9a7f-0e45245a04d0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"继续从未遍历的节点，寻找在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组中值最小的节点，是节点 2，它的值为 1，并且此时我们可以断定节点 0 离节点 2 的最短距离就是 1。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"83a5a9ff-25f3-475d-951b-8193c126da63","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为什么呢? 假设存在一条更短的路径从 0 到 2，例如是 0-1-2，但是因为此时 0-2 是最小的，而图中又不存在负权边，所以 0-1-2 比 0-1 还大，也就是比 0-2 大，所以 0-2 就是从 0 到 2 的最短路径。来到节点 2 之后，根据条件 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[2] + weight(2, w) < dis[w]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是否成立更新其相邻节点。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29890094/105998635-d60fbe80-60e7-11eb-833d-96b338557e09.png","previewUrl":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29890094/105998635-d60fbe80-60e7-11eb-833d-96b338557e09.png","width":643.7499744196743,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"19e3f970-2c47-4aef-a365-54478483298a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5b3f87e7-56f1-4b33-acc9-c760a17a54b8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"继续从未遍历的节点，寻找在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组中值最小的节点，此时 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[1]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":" dis[6]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值都是 2，随便选一个就可以，这里我选择节点 1，并且此时可以判定节点 0 到节点 1 的最短路径就是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[1]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 2。为什么?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"72f19a99-b67b-4e3f-9d4b-174d11c205ef","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设存在一条路径经过未遍历的节点从 0 到达节点 1，比如是节点 4 好了，因为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[1]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 此时是未遍历的节点中最小的，所以 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[1] < dis[4]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，更别说还要加上节点 4 到节点 1 的距离，矛盾，所以找不到一条经过未遍历节点来到节点 1。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"662432fe-e848-4748-b1e7-ab117e43c679","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那么是否存在一条路径只经过已经遍历过的节点到达节点 1，并且路径比 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[1]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 小，不妨假设存在这么一条路径 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0 -> ... -> s -> 1"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它的值比 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[1]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 小，即 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[s] + weight(s, 1) < dis[1]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么当我们之前遍历到节点 s 对相邻节点更新的时候就会更新 dis[1] 为更小的值，也产生了矛盾，因此也不存在一条路径只经过已经遍历过的节点到达节点 1。所以我们可以说此时的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[1]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就是从 0 到 1 的最短路径。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c3c31ed7-98f3-4b87-b3b9-2b8c3e87f912","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"来到节点 1 之后，更新其未被遍历过的相邻节点的值，当然图中节点 1 此时不存在未被遍历过的相邻节点，所以不进行任何的更新"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_9e772c5a-2db5-4250-8834-dda85891a950.webp","uuid":"3d3e6010-1bde-4f1e-9c7e-034817a24cd9","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_9e772c5a-2db5-4250-8834-dda85891a950.webp","width":658.7499738236279,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"d6b25bb7-5c7c-442d-891e-08ee928a8057","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e6f04b75-246d-4799-ac35-5035b5a1a4d7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"继续从未遍历的节点，寻找在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组中值最小的节点，找到节点 6，此时 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[6]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值为 2，并且此时我们可以判定从节点 0 到节点 6 的最短距离就是 2。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fac9288e-be5f-4d4b-8014-504ae5e2b5e1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"分析方法同上，先假设存在一条从未被遍历过的节点到达节点 6 得到的更短路径，但是因为 dis[6] 已经是从 0 到未被遍历的节点最小的，图中又不存在负权边，所以矛盾，再做假设存在只经过已被遍历过的节点到达节点 6，那么在之前 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[6]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值就会被更新为更小的值，也会产生矛盾，从而得到结论，不存在另外一条路径从 0 到 6 更短，此时 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[6]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就是从 0 到 6 的最短距离。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"edb1fe90-e9ca-4acc-9f34-72ae417e01b2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"来到节点 6 之后根据条件更新其未被遍历的相邻节点，图中节点 6 不存在未被遍历过的相邻节点，因此不作更新"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_3881ec35-71d2-4f69-a6ef-7eb03668f1de.webp","uuid":"66ea5e96-e50e-451a-b6c7-f82d67d323e7","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_3881ec35-71d2-4f69-a6ef-7eb03668f1de.webp","width":653.74997402231,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"8f3f30fc-2e69-4717-ad36-5f27bf73c5e6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2706e48e-335d-4f9f-baa9-5d729829aab0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"继续从未遍历的节点，寻找在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组中值最小的节点，发现 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[3]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[4]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 都是 3，我们就随便选择一个，这里选择节点 3，并且此时可以判定 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[3]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是从节点 0 到节点 3 的最短距离，已经分析过多次，不再分析。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"09a15b03-8908-42e8-a899-0e6912f527aa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"来到节点 3 之后，根据条件更新其未被遍历过的相邻节点，与节点 3 相邻未被遍历过的节点就是节点 4，但是并不满足 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[3] + 3 < dis[4]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的条件，所以不更新 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[4]"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_01ae7904-49fb-4fff-b322-ef86e5bc1392.webp","uuid":"2dd14140-0b24-4d56-af8c-5b1e8389afa0","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_01ae7904-49fb-4fff-b322-ef86e5bc1392.webp","width":647.4999742706627,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"7ef9957d-b80f-455f-8019-93cb52092c7b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f7765922-9bc6-4524-b93e-8fd7e5a32e20","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"重复上面的过程，我们可以得到下面这张表"}]},{"type":"table","tauContract":"6b49184b8918108ccf1636963138d105f679894dfe0d7b7abd75a6e6db67056b","collabId":"9bce6612-25ff-4160-a943-b55c2738d5e1","children":[{"type":"table-row","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","collabId":"f30c86d2-d697-4c8e-b689-378be2e6b490","children":[{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"b456a15c-3634-4482-9b51-99f655f00475","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"顶点"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"dbb0618e-bfd4-4b13-9ace-7fcac9b679c1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"58753b50-6a81-4ee0-9163-646029bca5dc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"1e5c75c7-7fd9-496c-8334-2a415f12500e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"fb47bdc7-2ec8-4a83-8320-ea747f5d0cfb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"3"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"c5e6e433-edb0-4461-9f72-c58a08e2f077","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"4"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"b39f1990-992e-49cf-bed4-88b64987f5db","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"5"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"0f6cabc7-f6ff-4569-ac31-450e94d90ee9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"6"}]}]},{"type":"table-row","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","collabId":"1c724829-718e-493a-9bdd-aa743f021a6e","children":[{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"cf1ec1bc-3df8-40d4-8d33-d1c1d109a709","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"dis"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"c23709ae-767d-4cc7-a1c2-0e4fc4336860","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"253bbc78-31eb-4027-9547-cefd819bc458","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"cf181b81-469d-419d-8326-76a3e50e5ea2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"606223b8-2f44-4976-b8ca-3bd89d818e1b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"3"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"5c6f4bf5-c5d2-4214-a42c-3298a9381e51","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"3"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"fdd5da8d-89f8-4e04-b206-62993231a2a9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"4"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"125c73f7-b0c0-409f-a80b-8cee87c656de","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5316c309-d699-4e7d-9ccd-fcd0cf9d677d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第二行的值表示原点到各点的最短路径。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bef11ef7-c2b7-4aec-aafa-4a4cf3cfaf28","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以 Dijkstra 算法就始终在重复两步："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"f15ece3f-1f76-48b1-90f5-c5a1a93e2db5","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3f90dcd7-5201-40e2-a4c7-639cf93f50d3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0e82b8e9-ac53-4fa4-9e69-af83fd630e06","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"寻找未被遍历节点中在 dis 数组中最小的那个节点"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3977e3e6-b417-4948-9ec9-497e3302849f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"15d0135d-8130-49ea-8c4d-bf175a0c7567","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"根据条件更新未被遍历过的相邻节点"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"adda7a41-66c7-46d7-af40-edc7a3a6dbe9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"寻找最小节点的操作我们使用一个优先队列来完成，直接从队首取出的值就是最小的，无需寻找"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"34ba628d-21d1-4b53-8b0b-33b35df887e3","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"84cae267-adcf-4eb9-be7b-54ad66a3d7cd","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"import java.util.*;\n\npublic class Dijkstra {\n    private WeightedGraph graph;\n    private int s;\n    private int[] dis;\n    private boolean[] visited;\n    // 求具体的路径用\n    private int[] pre;\n\n    public Dijkstra(WeightedGraph graph, int s) {\n        this.graph = graph;\n        graph.validateVertex(s);\n        this.s = s;\n\n        this.dis = new int[graph.V()];\n        this.visited = new boolean[graph.V()];\n        this.pre = new int[graph.V()];\n\n        // 初始化操作\n        Arrays.fill(pre, -1);\n        Arrays.fill(dis, Integer.MAX_VALUE);\n\n        pre[s] = s;\n        dis[s] = 0;\n\n        // 建立一个优先队列，Node 保存的是节点 dis[v] 的值\n        PriorityQueue<Node> queue =\n                new PriorityQueue<>((node1, node2) -> node1.getDis() - node2.getDis());\n        queue.add(new Node(s, 0));\n        while (!queue.isEmpty()) {\n\n            // 选出最小节点\n            int v = queue.remove().getV();\n\n            // 可能存在重复添加的情况，忽略\n            if (visited[v]) {\n                continue;\n            }\n            visited[v] = true;\n\n            // 更新未被遍历的相邻节点\n            for (int w: graph.adj(v)) {\n                if (!visited[w]) {\n                    dis[w] = Math.min(dis[w], dis[v] + graph.getWeight(v, w));\n                    // 将 dis[w] 添加进队列，可能会重复添加\n                    // 不过我们只对最小的那个感兴趣，重复添加取出后会被忽略\n                    queue.add(new Node(w, dis[w]));\n                    pre[w] = v;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    public int[] result() {\n        return dis;\n    }\n\n    // 获得源到节点 t 的具体路径\n    public Iterable<Integer> path(int t) {\n        ArrayList<Integer> path = new ArrayList<>();\n        if (!visited[t]) {\n            return path;\n        }\n        int cur = t;\n        while (cur != s) {\n            path.add(cur);\n            cur = pre[cur];\n        }\n        path.add(s);\n\n        Collections.reverse(path);\n        return path;\n    }\n}","collabId":"6dfaf41f-5d9b-4ce2-9dc1-b199eab44629","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"数据结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:593","type":"doc","id":593}},{"label":"图结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:594","type":"doc","id":594}},{"label":"最短路径算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:625","type":"doc","id":625}},{"label":"Dijkstra 算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:626","type":"doc","id":626}}],"prevPage":{"title":"最短路径算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:625","type":"doc","id":625}},"nextPage":{"title":"Bellman-Ford 算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:627","type":"doc","id":627}},"createTime":1702089338048,"updateTime":1775929439867,"projectId":40},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1775929439867}}